  "summaries": {
    "en": "Tartarus exploration scheduling, Theurgy abilities, Social Link priority, and full moon boss preparation for Persona 3 Reload.",
    "ja": "タルタロス探索スケジュール、テウルギー能力、コープ優先度、満月ボス準備を解説するペルソナ3 リロード攻略ガイド。"
  },
  "category": "jrpg",
  "difficulty": "intermediate",
  "thumbnail": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1614680376573-df3480f0c6ff?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop",
  "keyPoints": {
    "en": [
      "Theurgy abilities (Reload-exclusive) charge through specific actions per character—Mitsuru's Theurgy charges on inflicting status ailments, Akihiko's on taking damage. Build Theurgy usage into your rotation rather than saving it as an emergency tool.",
      "Tartarus progress is time-gated by barriers that lower on full-moon nights—plan to reach 25–30 floors above the minimum each barrier period to build in exploration buffer for exam weeks and Social Link events.",
      "Social Link rank-ups require specific conversation choices that must be made within the same in-game day as the Social Link event; failed rank attempts still pass time. Keep a guide reference for rank-up dialogue options for S-Links you prioritise.",
      "Tired status accumulates from consecutive Tartarus runs and reduces max HP/SP—never run Tartarus when party members show \"tired\" or \"sick\" status, as combat effectiveness drops to 60% baseline.",
      "Enemy arcanas in Tartarus match the Social Link arcanas—strengthening a Social Link before exploring a corresponding Tartarus block increases Persona fusion experience for that arcana by 50%."
    ],
    "ja": [
      "テウルギー（リロード専用）はキャラクターごとの特定行動でチャージされる。美鶴は状態異常付与でチャージ、明彦はダメージを受けてチャージ。緊急ツールとして温存するのではなく、ローテーションに組み込む。",
      "タルタロスの進行は満月夜に下がるバリアで時間制限される。試験週やコープイベントのバッファとして、各バリア期間中に最低階から25〜30階上まで到達する計画を立てる。",
      "コープのランクアップには、コープイベントと同じゲーム内日に特定の会話選択肢を選ぶ必要がある。失敗したランクアップ試みも時間を消費する。優先するコープのランクアップ選択肢はガイドを参照する。",
      "疲労状態は連続するタルタロスの探索で蓄積し、最大HP/SPを減少させる。パーティメンバーが「疲れた」「体調不良」ステータスの時はタルタロスを探索しない。戦闘効果が基本の60%に落ちる。",
      "タルタロスの敵のアルカナはコープのアルカナと一致する。対応するタルタロスブロックを探索する前にコープを強化すると、そのアルカナのペルソナ融合経験値が50%増加する。"
    ]
  },
  "opening": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "April–May Social Link Priority",
        "body": "The first two months determine which Social Links reach maximum rank before the game's time limit. Prioritise: Hierophant (Bunkichi and Mitsuko at Gekkoukan bookstore, available April 23), Moon (Nozomi at Paulownia Mall, available May 5), and Emperor (Student Council, available from game start). The Magician S-Link (Junpei) advances automatically through story—do not spend daytime slots on it. Evening slots should alternate between Tartarus runs and Arcana S-Links that only appear at night (Hermit: Maya online S-Link)."
      },
      {
        "title": "Persona Fusion Fundamentals",
        "body": "The Velvet Room's fusion system generates stronger Personas by combining two or more. Key rules: the resulting Persona's level is the average of the two combined, rounded up. Always fuse to create a Persona that is 2–3 levels above your current level for the best stat-to-cost ratio. Inherit skills carefully—the most valuable inherited skills are healing spells on offensive Personas (saves item slots) and resistance abilities that eliminate elemental weaknesses."
      }
    ]
  },
  "midGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Full Moon Boss Preparation",
        "body": "Full Moon Shadows appear on predetermined calendar dates and have unique mechanics not found in regular Tartarus. Preparation 3 days before any Full Moon: ensure the entire party is 5+ levels above the minimum recommended, stock 15+ Dis-Charm and Dis-Poison items (Full Moon Shadows inflict status ailments primarily), and have at least one party member with Recarm or Mediarama. Full Moon Shadows do not require the highest-damage approach—status ailment removal speed determines survival more than DPS."
      },
      {
        "title": "Tartarus Block Efficiency",
        "body": "Each Tartarus block (Thebel, Arqa, Yabbashah, etc.) has a recommended floor range per barrier period. Exceed the recommendation by 10+ floors each period to unlock the optional boss on the barrier floor before the period ends. Optional Tartarus bosses drop unique accessories and Arcana Cards that provide Social Link bonus experience. The Arqa optional boss (recommended floor 25, actual floor 40) drops the Necklace of the North Wind accessory that nullifies Wind damage—equipping this on Yukari removes her primary elemental weakness."
      }
    ]
  },
  "endGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Final Month and Nyx Preparation",
        "body": "The final month (January) is fully scripted with story events and Social Link epilogues—Tartarus exploration is limited to a 3-day window in early January. Use this window for a final stat item sweep from Monad blocks. Nyx has 12 phases corresponding to the 12 Arcana—for each phase, the optimal damage type shifts. Equip the protagonist with a versatile Persona covering Fire, Ice, Electric, and Wind for mid-battle switching. Stock 20+ High Calorie drinks (SP restoration) and 10+ Revival Beads before the final day."
      }
    ]
  },
  "mistakes": {
    "en": [
      "Spreading Social Link time across too many Arcana simultaneously—maxing 3 S-Links provides 3× fusion experience bonuses versus spreading across 10 for smaller bonuses; concentrate on 4–5 S-Links per playthrough.",
      "Ignoring Condition status for party members—party members decline invitations to Tartarus when tired/sick, wasting the entire evening slot; monitor condition in the morning and plan accordingly.",
      "Using Armageddon (the Judgement Arcana fusion skill) before Nyx—Armageddon deals 9,999 damage to all enemies but costs both characters fusing it enormous SP; save it exclusively for Nyx's final phase.",
      "Not saving before Full Moon events—Full Moon events occur on fixed calendar dates but their success depends on preparation level; saving the evening before allows a retry without replaying the preceding week.",
      "Fusing away Personas with unique inherited skills before recording them—the Persona Compendium allows re-summoning registered Personas at their registered level; always register a Persona before fusing it away."
    ],
    "ja": [
      "同時に多くのコープに時間を分散する。3つのコープを最大化すると3つ分の融合経験値ボーナスが得られる。10個に分散するより少数のボーナスしか得られない。1周あたり4〜5個のコープに集中する。",
      "パーティメンバーのコンディションを無視する。疲労・体調不良のメンバーはタルタロス探索への誘いを断り、夜のスロット全体が無駄になる。朝にコンディションを確認して計画を立てる。",
      "ニクス前にアルマゲドン（審判のアルカナ融合スキル）を使う。全敵に9,999ダメージを与えるが、融合する両キャラクターが莫大なSPを消費する。ニクスの最終フェーズ専用に温存する。",
      "満月イベント前にセーブしない。満月イベントは固定カレンダーで発生するが、成否は準備レベルに依存する。前夜にセーブすれば前の週を再プレイせずに再試行できる。",
      "ユニークな継承スキルを持つペルソナを記録せずに融合する。ペルソナ大全は登録済みのペルソナを登録レベルで再召喚できる。融合前に必ずペルソナを登録する。"
    ]
